        "extract": "Citizen Sleeper is a 2022 role-playing video game by Jump Over the Age and published by Fellow Traveller for macOS, Microsoft Windows, Nintendo Switch, Xbox One, and Xbox Series X/S on 5 May 2022. It was also released for PlayStation 4 and PlayStation 5 on 31 March 2023. A port for Nintendo Switch 2 was released on 25 June 2026.\nA sequel, titled Citizen Sleeper 2: Starward Vector, was released on 31 January 2025.",
